           tmp_i = sum_j A[i][j] * x[j]
           y_i   = sum_j B[i][j] * x[j]
         Access patterns:
           - Arow[j], Brow[j], x1[j] are all unit-stride.
           - No loop-carried dependencies, no aliasing between A/B/x/y/tmp. */
